<title>USA: NYMEX says ACCESS trading has technical delays.</title>
<headline>NYMEX says ACCESS trading has technical delays.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Mercantile Exchange (NYMEX) said Tuesday that trading on its after-hours system is delayed because of technical problems.</p>
<p>The source of the problem was being investigated and there was no estimate of when trading would commence, a NYMEX spokesperson said.</p>
<p>--New York Energy Desk, +1 212 859 1620</p>
